    "description": "FLQLon is an Ondo Global Markets tokenized ETF exposure designed to provide economic exposure to Franklin U.S. Large Cap Multifactor Index ETF, which seeks to track the LibertyQ U.S. Large Cap Equity Index. The underlying Franklin ETF is a rules-based multifactor strategy built around quality, value, and momentum signals. The token is designed to be fully backed by the underlying publicly traded ETF, together with cash in transit, held with regulated custodial broker-dealers. Tokenholders are not shareholders of the underlying and do not receive shareholder voting rights.",
